# shadcn/ui look (Upside Lab)

Black field. Lifted cards. Comfortable density (`gap-6` / `p-6`). One accent (`primary` is near-white). Compose primitives. Do not restyle a component with extra colors.

## Tokens

`bg-background` is black. Cards are `bg-card` with `ring-1 ring-foreground/10`. Nested surfaces are `bg-muted rounded-lg`, never a card in a card.

Money up/down is `text-gain` / `text-destructive`. Not a wash.

## Density

- Page titles: `text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight`. Card titles: `text-lg`. Body: `text-sm`. Labels: `text-xs text-muted-foreground`.
- Scoreboard figures: `text-2xl`. Each Score is its own card with `gap-4` between cards, not a hairline bar.
- Controls are `h-8` / `rounded-lg`. Only the signed-out landing CTA is `h-10 rounded-full`.
- Page gutter is `px-6`. Panel pad is `p-6`. Drawers and overlays use the same pad.

## Primitives

Button (variants, no `btn-primary`). Input / Field / FieldGroup. Card header/content/footer. AlertDialog for confirm. Empty for empty. ToggleGroup for 2–7 choices. Badge not custom chips. Avatar with Fallback. Sonner toasts.

`gap-*` not `space-y-*`. `size-8` not `h-8 w-8`. `cn()` for conditionals. Icons in buttons: `data-icon`, no extra size class.
